{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_title", "source_sha256": "2fa65fadb97fbd81e22e07a02ff25b8766275b2a22ce788548e559d375faede8", "ja": "こちら、方針決まり次第、追加で依頼いたします。", "zh": "这边会在方针确定后，再追加委托。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2fa65fadb97fbd81e22e07a02ff25b8766275b2a22ce788548e559d375faede8", "ja": "こちら、方針決まり次第、追加で依頼いたします。", "zh": "这边会在方针确定后，再追加委托。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0e6becb0b66fc6b8501aecea06d37188de7f4dd3871575ddafafcee2359c205e", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま。今度の公演なんだけど……ん？\n難しい顔して、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "大家辛苦了，关于下次的公演……嗯？\n愁眉苦脸的，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "6070447d0fd84febdb834b7628e50ae047c668b311c38a575241f5eb3e09eb46", "ja": "あっ……。\n{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "啊……\n{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "8fc7d1cf839734ceb79d365af3921928472e1d45039a8376de9de04d6f4bbe01", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ナイスタイミング！\nいいところに来てくれました～！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，Nice Timing！\n你来得正好～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "5e38ba78f8384885615a4bf0a1ee0393dc04d061ff79e5f768f1185275044070", "ja": "あの！　今度のライブで、私に\n新しい曲を歌わせてもらえませんか！？", "zh": "请问！下次的演唱会，\n可以让我唱新歌吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3c3dfb4f4b792213c4e9218ee4c5d96bf77fa1bf7556c2924139ed8f514a5f90", "ja": "新しい曲？\n可奈、どこでその話を聞いたんだ？", "zh": "新歌？\n可奈，你从哪听到消息的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "7e1f720c823191dc8c9c5bbe18ab82e85dadb46b2c08fbb3d85c907506e56838", "ja": "……？\nそれって、もしかして……。", "zh": "咦……？\n这意思难道是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_1006_p", "source_sha256": "aaecb392643520f18e61cf9fc3d445fad9da22ebef422868ee0e87202eea0365", "ja": "ああ、今度の公演の曲だ。\nちょうど、デモができたところだよ。", "zh": "嗯，就是下次公演的新歌。\nDEMO正好完成了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "8a1a128b7ec8922d6432378b72fa5f41e53c7606ba7c6f1ba2d11b49f367d92b", "ja": "じゃあ、本当に……？", "zh": "这么说来，是真的可以……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "5e9e24526cd59727dfdd8a20683cd0eafe6b95d0d1964ea5b2b835852357724b", "ja": "わーっ！？\n次のライブで、新しい曲が歌えるんですね！？", "zh": "哇──！？\n下次演唱会，可以唱新歌对吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "a3640358db7212d93ca0416e547451cf652ec00d77e0497997e1aa78171c9247", "ja": "すごい……。", "zh": "真惊人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "1375da0b88ffb9d4fccc11e576c6c9b06abe4f46a57a97a6c27322945ff323aa", "ja": "……{$P$}さん。\nその曲、私に歌わせてもらえませんか？", "zh": "……{$P$}先生。\n那首新歌，可以让我来唱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "887de978b2d638479c75a5c77fed60e895cb169a997e5a7e8e069511e748e168", "ja": "はれっ？　えっと……し、志保ちゃんは先に、\n今ある曲を身につけるんじゃなかったっけ？", "zh": "咦？呃……志、志保刚刚不是说\n要把现有的歌练到完美吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "88c3f6d838312851bebbfa4a402a5ab97049358acb105e4796a794468488f75d", "ja": "それは可奈に言ったの。\n私のことじゃないわ。", "zh": "那是对可奈说的。\n讲的不是我自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "81f0db599d4322b7eb1074a8b499fc58b6151b22f09dead867b94b0dcc403f17", "ja": "うう、そんなぁ～！", "zh": "呜呜，怎么这样～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_1014_p", "source_sha256": "03c4cbeefa01d42595d275271769a23962bd1cde9d0791a3ee03060328af51b9", "ja": "そうか、みんな新しい曲が歌いたいんだな。\nでも、まだどうするかは決めてないんだ。", "zh": "哦～原来大家都想唱新歌啊。\n不过，我还没想好要怎么安排。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "cffe80e5684414adb7ba48c8c66525a83756e3ad46f9495f9d9523ddddc01f69", "ja": "じゃあ……。\n杏奈も、歌える……？", "zh": "这么说……\n杏奈也有机会……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7ae2be029ec1bb9911bd0efad860049c4309f885ab9a41d4db90bdbc5dd2ce5b", "ja": "そうだな。\n杏奈が歌う可能性だってあるぞ。", "zh": "没错。\n我也有可能会交给杏奈唱喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "dca02daef71fef37559ba0339f7bb4035324925b5eaa2a95348d03fb0c768cc7", "ja": "わっ……わかりましたぁ！", "zh": "我……我明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "e383bab541da7555c0dc96b52cb5c107208117a52fb3ea780881ce9bed698d9c", "ja": "私、新しい曲を歌わせてもらえるように、頑張ります！\n見ててくださいね、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "我会加油，让自己得到唱新歌的资格！\n你要关注我的表现喔，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "892bb504d38bb6e334f913a4e32d8f7348cffd6430f039c921b89d7d96ef5210", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n私も立候補してること、忘れないでくださいね。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n你别忘了我也有意愿喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "1e53d852d6a630ec1593a1be472a903cb3f9e8bc837076538a2438da7c2c025b", "ja": "杏奈も……新しい曲、歌いたい……から……。\n……頑張り、ます……！", "zh": "杏奈……也想唱新歌……所以……\n……会加油的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_016_1021_p", "source_sha256": "f584472a7d01bff89fc662c01974cddf1c856e8c37ca5b1432100d53fb61af64", "ja": "（みんな、火花を散らしてるな……。\nでも、やる気がいっぱいなのはいいことだ！）", "zh": "（每个人都战意满满的……\n不过，充满干劲是好事！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
